.IX Title "Lucy::Search::LeafQuery 3pm"
.TH Lucy::Search::LeafQuery 3pm 2026-09-16 "perl v5.40.1" "User Contributed Perl Documentation"
.\" For nroff, turn off justification.  Always turn off hyphenation; it makes
.\" way too many mistakes in technical documents.
.if n .ad l
.nh
.SH NAME
Lucy::Search::LeafQuery \- Leaf node in a tree created by QueryParser.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.IX Header "SYNOPSIS"
.Vb 2
\&    package MyQueryParser;
\&    use base qw( Lucy::Search::QueryParser );
\&
\&    sub expand_leaf {
\&        my ( $self, $leaf_query ) = @_;
\&        if ( $leaf_query\->get_text =~ /.\e*\es*$/ ) {
\&            return PrefixQuery\->new(
\&                query_string => $leaf_query\->get_text,
\&                field        => $leaf_query\->get_field,
\&            );
\&        }
\&        else {
\&            return $self\->SUPER::expand_leaf($leaf_query);
\&        }
\&    }
.Ve
.SH DESCRIPTION
.IX Header "DESCRIPTION"
LeafQuery objects serve as leaf nodes in the tree structure generated by
QueryParser’s \fBtree()\fR method.
Ultimately, they must be transformed, typically into either
TermQuery or
PhraseQuery objects, as attempting to
search a LeafQuery causes an error.
.SH CONSTRUCTORS
.IX Header "CONSTRUCTORS"
.SS new
.IX Subsection "new"
.Vb 4
\&    my $leaf_query = Lucy::Search::LeafQuery\->new(
\&        text  => \*(Aq"three blind mice"\*(Aq,    # required
\&        field => \*(Aqcontent\*(Aq,               # default: undef
\&    );
.Ve
.PP
Create a new LeafQuery.
.IP \(bu 4
\&\fBfield\fR \- Optional field name.
.IP \(bu 4
\&\fBtext\fR \- Raw query text.
.SH METHODS
.IX Header "METHODS"
.SS get_field
.IX Subsection "get_field"
.Vb 1
\&    my $string = $leaf_query\->get_field();
.Ve
.PP
Accessor for object’s \f(CW\*(C`field\*(C'\fR attribute.
.SS get_text
.IX Subsection "get_text"
.Vb 1
\&    my $string = $leaf_query\->get_text();
.Ve
.PP
Accessor for object’s \f(CW\*(C`text\*(C'\fR attribute.
.SS make_compiler
.IX Subsection "make_compiler"
.Vb 5
\&    my $compiler = $leaf_query\->make_compiler(
\&        searcher    => $searcher,     # required
\&        boost       => $boost,        # required
\&        subordinate => $subordinate,  # default: false
\&    );
.Ve
.PP
Throws an error.
.SH INHERITANCE
.IX Header "INHERITANCE"
Lucy::Search::LeafQuery isa Lucy::Search::Query isa Clownfish::Obj.
